{"overview":"ژاپن خودروهای الکتریکی خودران را به کار می‌گیرد و تا سال 202X اکثر موتورهای بنزینی را منسوخ می‌کند. سریع‌ترین خودروها در MFG، یک مسابقه‌سرعت بر روی بزرگراه‌های ژاپن، جان می‌گیرند. رانندگانی از سراسر جهان برای کسب عنوان در این مسابقه می‌جنگند. کاناتا ریونگتون از بریتانیا به ژاپن برای MFG و برای یافتن پدرش بازمی‌گردد. آیا می‌تواند عنوان را بگیرد و پاسخ‌ها را پیدا کند؟ کمربندها را ببندید و تا حد امکان پیش بروید!","tagline":"","overview_en":"Japan adopts self-driving electric automobiles and renders most gas engines obsolete by 202X. The fastest cars find new life in the MFG, a racing circuit held on Japanese motorways. Drivers from around the world race for a shot at the title. Kanata Rivington returns from Britain to Japan for the MFG—and to find his father. Can he win the title and find answers? Buckle up and push it to the limit!","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":2,"y":2024,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":37,"y":2023,"poster":"/vMnd8iqPwOOoIZ9a2RcqAHppDoq.jpg"}],"episodes":37,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"内田雄馬","role":"Kanata Rivington (Kanata Katagiri) (voice)","photo":"/2otstbLfQ7MXuFt1X8MFOb4OIgd.jpg","en":"Yuma Uchida"},{"name":"佐倉綾音","role":"Ren Saionji / Seven (voice)","photo":"/yPbTmntASE9psPIMhNGU5oo6vIH.jpg","en":"Ayane Sakura"}],"trailer":"evM8AAQVLZ8","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/154526-mf/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/154526-mf/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channe